From 143401de68998e065e9f2a18cfc42c2ae9bc1da8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christian Roessner <c@roessner.co>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 08:19:08 +0200
Subject: [PATCH v2 1/2] bounce: mark locally generated DSNs

Set one internal cleanup flag only when bounce(8) posts a null-sender delivery status notification. Ordinary Postfix submissions, non-bounce notices, and externally received messages leave the flag clear.
---
